# Template env cap root cho du an "He thong dang ky mon hoc".
#
# Cong nghe chinh:
# - Frontend: React 19, TypeScript 5.8, Vite 6, Tailwind CSS 4, lucide-react, npm.
# - Backend: Java 21, Spring Boot 3.3, Maven Wrapper, JSON File IO.
#
# Can cai truoc khi chay:
# - Git
# - Node.js 20 tro len
# - npm 10 tro len
# - JDK 21
#
# Starter hien tai chua yeu cau bien moi truong bat buoc o root.
# Khong commit .env, .env.local hoac secret that len GitHub.
# Frontend dung file mau rieng tai frontend/.env.example.
